#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Sealed Phase 7 analysis controller for the all-local URA campaign.

This file has two deliberately separate modes. ``prepare`` validates completed
Phase 6 controller evidence and writes one deterministic, create-only input
manifest. ``execute`` accepts only a launch record that binds an explicitly
authorized digest of those exact bytes. No target, judge, installer, downloader,
or human-audit command is reachable from this controller.
"""

